 course builds upon the differential calculus covered in Calculus I , providing in-depth coverage of integral calculus including integration techniques, applications of integration. Advanced topics such as series convergence tests, Taylor series, calculus with parametric and polar equations, and introductory differential equations are also covered. This comprehensive course will prepare students for further studies in advanced mathematics, engineering, statistics, machine learning, and other fields requiring a solid foundation in integral calculus." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1009 "Further your understanding of calculus: master advanced integration techniques, model real-world situations using differential equations, and more." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1012 106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1013 "CA2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "4965f9cc-fd21-5d50-b441-6e80983b17dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048204 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050868 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083282 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083283 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1031 "Writing an Infinite Geometric Series in Sigma Notation" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1033 686 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050286 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "3d2565fe-3398-554f-a31a-0bf45334348f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050529 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083284 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050529 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083285 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050529 #edb/ref 1031 "Repeating Decimals as Infinite Geometric Series" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050529 #edb/ref 1033 689 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186050529 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "508d3e6c-0cb1-59bd-b93a-329774355507" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081078 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081079 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081080 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081081 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186081082 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081077 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7ef4297c-0c05-56d2-a418-f8b435501b80" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081078 #edb/ref 1080 "7 + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{8}{9}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081078 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081078 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "803467b1-2020-5624-a5ad-19640860beed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081079 #edb/ref 1080 "7.8 + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{7}{10}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081079 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081079 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c2818ad8-51ea-5375-b9df-40101f92ab9c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081080 #edb/ref 1080 "7.8 + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{8}{10}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081080 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081080 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ef6d241d-38e7-550f-8a38-abc833ff722d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081081 #edb/ref 1080 "7.8 + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{7}{10}(\\frac{1}{100})^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081081 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081081 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0fe3b103-34c1-50b3-88e4-db64f9c0f245" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081082 #edb/ref 1080 "7.8 + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{7}{100}(\\frac{1}{100})^{n}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081082 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186081082 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "10e59e9c-64bc-5792-9a7c-3a893db2ef41" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083086 #edb/ref 1069 "e-694" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083086 #edb/ref 1071 "Write $0.\\overline{23}$ as geometric series." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083086 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "acebcd95-16ed-5087-8d04-0d6d503e31f3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083086 #edb/ref 1074 "The given repeating decimal can be written as\n\n$$\n0.\\overline{23} = 0.23 + 0.002\\,3 + 0.000\\,023 + \\dots\n$$\n\n$$\n0.\\overline{23} = \\dfrac{23}{100} + \\dfrac{23}{10\\,000} + \\dfrac{23}{1\\,000\\,000}+\\dots\n$$\n\nwhere the first term is\n\n$$\na_1 = \\dfrac{23}{100}\n$$\n\nand the common ratio is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{1}{100}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0.23^(―) &= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)a_{1}r^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{23}{100} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{100})^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)23 \\cdot \\frac{1}{100} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{100})^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)23 \\cdot \\frac{1}{100} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{100})^{n} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{100})^{-1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)23(\\frac{1}{100})^{n}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083087 #edb/ref 1069 "e-695" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083087 #edb/ref 1071 "Write $0.1\\overline{4}$ as geometric series." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083087 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ed24fd0c-69c1-502a-a05f-6e859724214a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083087 #edb/ref 1074 "The given repeating decimal can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0.14^(―) &= 0.1444... \\\\\n&= 0.1 + 0.04 + 0.004 + 0.0004 + … \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10} + (\\frac{4}{100} + \\frac{4}{1000} + \\frac{4}{10000} + …)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe series in the parentheses is a geometric series with the first term\n\n$$\na_1 = \\dfrac{4}{100}\n$$\n\nand the common ratio\n\n$$\nr=\\dfrac{1}{10}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0.14^(―) &= \\frac{1}{10} + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)a_{1}r^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10} + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{4}{100}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10} + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{4 \\cdot 10}{100}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n} \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{10} + ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{4}{10}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186050286 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083792 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083793 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1039 "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as an Infinite Geometric Series" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186083086 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083284 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "367fe9fb-9d92-5105-9959-f3861994aa3c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083691 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186234032 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1039 "Expressing a Repeating Decimal as the Sum of a Number and a Geometric Series" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186083087 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083285 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "8813b8a0-3b5e-5cd8-a37d-6b921f2882b8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186084209 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186084210 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186084211 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1045 "Repeating Decimals as Infinite Geometric Series" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186084209 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050529 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083401 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "599eb266-615f-5404-b22e-4ae2f5fb387a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083691 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186081077 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083691 #edb/ref 1069 "q-40687" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083691 #edb/ref 1071 "What is $7.87^(―)$?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083691 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "4d2e6148-1311-589a-937a-5889bc0f6bfe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084209 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186084210 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084209 #edb/ref 1061 2380 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084209 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d0db37f3-c116-58a6-a33d-41ca478ae931" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084209 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186084397 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084210 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186084211 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084210 #edb/ref 1061 2381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084210 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "af145878-806f-54bc-991b-28bc9b80cc8a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084210 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186083284 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084211 #edb/ref 1061 2385 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084211 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4af12d7e-248c-5555-bd4c-98e9849f98a8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084211 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186083285 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084397 #edb/ref 1064 "A repeating decimal can be expressed as a geometric series whose common ratio is a power of\n\n$$\n\\dfrac 1 {10}\n$$\n\nFor example, the number $0.\\overline{8}$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0.8^(―) &= 0.8 + 0.08 + 0.008 + … \\\\\n&= \\frac{8}{10} + \\frac{8}{100} + \\frac{8}{1000} + …\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\na_1 = \\dfrac{8}{10}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\nr = \\dfrac {0.08}{0.8} = \\dfrac 1 {10}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0.8^(―) &= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)a_{1}r^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)\\frac{8}{10}(\\frac{1}{10})^{n - 1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{10} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{10})^{n} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{10})^{-1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{10} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{10})^{n} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{10})^{-1} \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{10} \\cdot (\\frac{1}{10})^{n} \\cdot 10 \\\\\n&= ∑_(n = 1)^(∞)8(\\frac{1}{10})^{n}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084397 #edb/ref 1065 1212 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084397 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "3998b477-1c28-5edc-8605-2738ce474d94" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186084397 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
